      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§bTiers unlock in order, in three steps.§r\n1. §bMilestones§r on the current star: §b20,000,000 L Raw Star Matter§r made and §b2 h Resonant§r. The GUI and scanner count them, and they stay with the controller through a wrench.\n2. §bThe core.§r Right-click the controller with the §bStellar Mass Core§r. It goes into escrow and is consumed §lonly when the transition succeeds§r. Sneak-punch with an empty hand to take it back.\n3. §bThe transition.§r Build the §bbeam band§r (hologram stack 2: 2,856 Beam Band Casing), bring compression to tier 2, buffer §b5,000,000 L Raw Star Matter§r, then put §bStar Chart: Sirius A§r in the slot while Sol burns. §bMass Infusion§r runs for 10 minutes: the RSPM pours into Sol and P is pushed §b+4 a second§r, so your rig must hold. Survive it and Sol becomes Sirius A, with T2 unlocked for good.\n\n§e§lRUN§r Sirius A takes §b12,500,000 L H + 12,500,000 L He + 25,000 L RSPM§r a cycle and makes §b2,500 L Excited Stellar Plasma§r.\n\n[warn]Sirius A drifts hard and breaches if left alone. Run the rig. Helium trims leave §lash: −0.5 % yield per 1,000 L§r dosed that second, so a two-stage rig (small doses near the target, big ones far out) beats full-blast valves.[/warn]\n\n[note]A higher Eye still hosts lower stars, at ×2 parallel per tier above. There is one live star per Eye.[/note]\n\n§a§lDONE WHEN§r you hold the core and the chart (HOLD → CLAIM → INSTALL: claim before the core goes into escrow).",
